WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.750
Welcome to the Industry Team Facilitator orientation.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.025
Guide Industry Team's discussion, review the Scribe handoff,

00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:09.588
project the working record, and submit the final team

00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:11.262
artifact to White Cell.

00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:14.312
Your workflow moves from framing the discussion, to reviewing

00:00:14.312 --> 00:00:17.188
the Scribe’s record, to projecting and submitting the agreed

00:00:17.188 --> 00:00:18.288
artifact.

00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:22.550
Keep presentation, editing, and submission as separate decisions

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:22.688
.

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:26.012
The team remains responsible for its judgment, while White

00:00:26.012 --> 00:00:28.475
Cell remains responsible for review.
